# Reproducible engine outputs (byte-identical on rebuild; hashes in */v*/*.meta.json and MANIFEST.json)
*/v*/render/*.stems/
*/v*/render/*.wav
*/v*/render/*.mid
# V1 and control assets are reproducible from source with build.mjs; V2 assets are kept so
# the engine projects re-render directly with `daemonv12 render`
*/v1/project/assets/
# The fixed-120 control (round 2) follows the same rules
*/control120/render/*.stems/
*/control120/render/*.wav
*/control120/render/*.mid
*/control120/project/assets/
